The '''PZ Data''' project is a collection of datasets which provide data regarding [[Scripts]], [[Translation]], [[Lua (API)|Lua]] and [[Java]]. It is composed of 2 types of datasets:
* ''Data'' types - manually written datasets which provide various documentation written by hand by the community.
* ''Parser'' types - automatically generated datasets from the game files, be it the [[Decompiling game code|decompiled Java code]] or the [[Lua (API)|Lua]] files.

They are notably used to provide [[github:PZ-Wiki-Modding/pz-translation-data#schemas|schemas]] for validation of translation files. Schemas for the XML files of the game are also provided [[github:PZ-Wiki-Modding/pz-xml-data#schemas|here]].

